# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — nothing here may ever be committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Solana keypairs are plain JSON byte arrays. A committed one is an immediate,
# unrecoverable loss of whatever it controls.
*keypair*.json
*-key.json
crank-key.json
id.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output and dependencies
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
target/
.anchor/
test-ledger/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy — the earlier DiamondHands project.
#
# Excluded deliberately rather than deleted: it still contains a different
# token's live mainnet addresses, and publishing it alongside BullBank would
# confuse anyone trying to verify which program is which.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Every pattern below is anchored with a leading slash so it matches ONLY at the
# repo root. Unanchored, `lib.rs` would also have excluded
# program/programs/memecoin-staking/src/lib.rs — the actual program, i.e. the
# entire point of publishing this — and `index.html` would have excluded the
# app's entry point, leaving the site unbuildable.
/index.html
/index.html.bak
/gitgub/
/lib.rs
/lib_sol.rs
/lib_tiers.rs
/staking.ts
/staking sol1.ts
/staking_tiers.ts
/crank.ts
/crank-mainnet.ts
/init-pool.ts
/PROJECT_STATUS_1.md
/TOKENOMICS.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.claude/settings.local.json
